### Phase 1: API Gateway Verification Tests
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Gateway Actuator Health Check
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Standard /internal path (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/internal/classes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/verify-teacher
Accept: application/json

### 3. Uppercase /INTERNAL path (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/INTERNAL/classes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/verify-teacher
Accept: application/json

### 4. Mixed-case /InTeRnAl path (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/InTeRnAl/classes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/verify-teacher
Accept: application/json

### 5. URL-encoded /%69%6e%74%65%72%6e%61%6c path (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/%69%6e%74%65%72%6e%61%6c/classes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/verify-teacher
Accept: application/json

### 6. Double-slash //internal// path (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}//internal//classes/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/verify-teacher
Accept: application/json

### 7. Path traversal with dot-segments /api/auth/../internal/test (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/../internal/test
Accept: application/json

### 8. Matrix parameter /internal;param=value/test (Must return 403 Forbidden)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/internal;jsessionid=999/classes
Accept: application/json

### 9. Verify client-sent X-Internal-Token on public route is stripped
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/api/auth/me
X-Internal-Token: malicious-spoofed-token
Accept: application/json
